In article <2778@korppi.tut.fi> pl@tut.fi (Pertti Lehtinen) writes:
>From article <199@mutley.UUCP>, by root@mutley.UUCP (System Administrator):
>> I'm looking for PDP-hack.  Where can I get it?  I want to run hack
>> on an '11, and this looks like the one I need.

Hack was originaly written for the PDP-11 - so I am assuming that when you
say you want PDP-hack, you want the original.  The author, Jay Fenlason,
is still on the net somewhere (I believe he is involved with the GNU effort
in some way).  If I recall correctly, his address is in the readme file
of the most recent nethack posting.

If you can't get ahold of him, I have a copy of the original hack that was
ported to the PC.  While this may not help you much (the game is called
"hack" for a reason), you might be able to port it back to the PDP.  Let me
know if you want it; I'll mail it to you.


